    "title": "Perseid Meteor Shower Peaks Over Richmond, No Moon to Spoil the Show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Beth Carter ,\n9 hours ago The Perseid meteor shower peaks over Richmond Wednesday into Thursday this week, arriving under a dark new moon that strips away the lunar glow normally washing out fainter shooting stars. At its best, the shower can produce 30 to 50 meteors an hour, and this year's moonless timing gives Central Virginia stargazers one of their clearest shots at the show in recent memory. Read full article\n1",
